			<td class="lt-chem-46734">Suppose that another compound, <i>w</i>, has a vapor density of 1.38 g liter<sup>-1</sup>, and an analysis of 38.7% C, 9.4% H, and 51.6% S by weight. How would this force you to revise your conclusions for Example 1?</td>
